        },
        {
          "text": "No ku musi wo kuzana ivyimburwa vy’umushuzo, igihe munshikanira ishikanwa ry’umushuzo, jewe Uhoraho, ku musi mukuru ukurikira amasabato ndwi, muze mukoranywe no kuba ikoraniro ryera: ntihaze hagire igikorwa kiruhisha muwukorako. ",
