              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamwe n’ ishikanwa ry’ifu bigendanye, ifu igogōretse ivanzwe n’amavuta ya elayo: iryo ku masa yose ribe ibigiracumi bitatu vya efa, iryo ku mpfizi y’intama ribe ibigiracumi bibiri vya efa nyene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
